<title>USA: Skylands Community Bank names CFO.</title>
<headline>Skylands Community Bank names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HACKETTSTOWN, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Skylands Community Bank said Wednesday it named Edward Mahnken chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Mahnken had been chief financial officer at Farrington Bank in North Brunswick, N.J.</p>
